Elevator

- user can press a up or down button to call elevator on hall panel
- elevator will come and door will open
- user will enter elevator
- user will press desired floor button on elevator panel
- elevator will add that floor to its list of stops and start moving


Entities

Elevator
ElevatorPanel
HallPanel
Door
ElevatorControl


Swappable logic
- Control can schedule which elevator will service user request from hall
- Elevator can have its motion control, where to go first